    <title>
        fix(security): harden auth gate, identity propagation, and deploy-tim…
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-08T00:21:03Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8320384?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>AndroEhab</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/AndroEhab</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;fix(security): harden auth gate, identity propagation, and deploy-time safety

- Functions: fix isProductionRuntime() to detect GCF via FUNCTIONS_EMULATOR
  instead of NODE_ENV (which GCF never sets), closing the fail-open auth gate
- Functions: verify X-API-Key + Auth0 JWT on all production requests
- MCP server: enforce Auth0 on public HTTP /mcp, fail-closed deploy guard
- MCP server: forward caller Bearer token for backend identity propagation&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
